+
+### 3. Slack MCP Server
+- **Configuration Page**: `/sso/v1/integrations/mcp/slack`
+- **API Endpoint**: `/api/v1/integrations/mcp/slack/add` (POST)
+- **Proxy Endpoint**: `/api/v1/mcp-integrations/slack/execute` (POST)
